{"id":"9ca7bc5a-ea91-45c1-888a-41d04dc24562","object":"chat.completion","created":1785036240,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\":\"def solve(case):\\n    word_token_indices = case['word_token_indices']\\n    word_labels = case['word_labels']\\n    token_count = case['token_count']\\n    # Validation\\n    if not (len(word_token_indices) == len(word_labels)):\\n        raise ValueError('Mismatched lengths')\\n    # Check out-of-range, duplicates, uncovered\\n    seen = set()\\n    total = 0\\n    for group in word_token_indices:\\n        for idx in group:\\n            if not (0 <= idx < token_count):\\n                raise ValueError(f'Index {idx} out of range')\\n            if idx in seen:\\n                raise ValueError(f'Duplicate index {idx}')\\n            seen.add(idx)\\n            total += 1\\n    if total != token_count:\\n        raise ValueError(f'Uncovered tokens: {token_count - total} missing')\\n    token_labels = [0] * token_count\\n    for group, label in zip(word_token_indices, word_labels):\\n        for idx in group:\\n            token_labels[idx] = label\\n    kept_indices = [i for i, v in enumerate(token_labels) if v == 1]\\n    return {'kept_indices': kept_indices, 'token_labels': token_labels}\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for NLP-LL2-01. Input case is payload with fields: word_token_indices (list of lists of ints), word_labels (list of ints, each 0 or 1), token_count (int). No other fields. Output must be dict with \"kept_indices\" (list of ints) and \"token_labels\" (list of ints length token_count). Additional properties false.\n\nLogic: For each word group i, its token indices are word_token_indices[i]. Its label is word_labels[i]. We need to produce token_labels array of length token_count, initialized to 0 (or maybe -1? But spec says token_labels are integers, presumably 0/1). Project word label to each token in that group. Ensur